OL,3,GNEWSABonfire and fireworks cancelled
OL,4,Aover safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bonfire Night and fireworks event has
OL,7,Fbeen cancelled for the second year in a
OL,8,Frow after organisers said it could not
OL,9,Fbe held safely within the available
OL,10,Fbudget.
OL,12,FThe event was due to be held in Truro
OL,13,Fand was expected to attract up to 5,000
OL,14,Fpeople, with plans developed over the
OL,15,Fsummer to manage crowds, traffic and
OL,16,Femergency access.
OL,18,FTown clerk David Rodda said the council
OL,19,Fmade the decision not to go ahead
OL,20,Freluctantly and knew it would be "a
OL,21,Fdisappointment for many residents".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
