OL,3,GNEWSABonfire and fireworks cancelled
OL,4,Aover safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it would continue to
OL,7,Flook at ways of overcoming the
OL,8,Fchallenges of organising the event and
OL,9,Fit aimed to hold a safe and affordable
OL,10,Fdisplay in future.
